# Description: The ABC script of abc -constr without its first steps
# (&fraig -x, scorr, dc2, dretime), which rewrite the logic for area
# and do not keep its depth. Usage in Yosys, after synth -noabc:
# abc -script keep.abc -constr <file> -liberty <file>
strash
&get -n
&dch -f
&nf
&put
buffer
upsize
dnsize
stime -p
